  "title": "Garlic Butter Mushrooms",
  "description": "Whole roasted mushrooms with minced garlic, butter, Parmesan cheese, and parsley make for a fabulous, flavorsome side dish or vegetarian appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
